From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opencode-port <port@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:55:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] D207 server: command, reference and vcs routes wait for
 plugins

Upstream: GET /api/command, /api/reference, /api/vcs, /api/vcs/base, /api/vcs/status, /api/vcs/branch and
/api/vcs/diff answer as soon as the location is built, before its plugins have registered config commands,
references and the git provider, so right after a location boots they list only built-in commands, no references,
and no repository (empty status and diff). /api/agent and /api/skill already wait (upstream fixed /api/skill the
same way in #62569).
Fixed: these routes wait for plugin activation like /api/skill (503 ServiceUnavailableError when it times out).
Scenarios: project-commands.test.ts "command list on a location's first request" (new); project-skills.test.ts
"references on a location's first request" (new); project-vcs.test.ts "vcs routes on a location's first
request" (new), "vcs routes from a nested location" (the nested location's status and diff were empty)
Upstream tests: packages/server/test/command.test.ts (new); client and openapi.json regenerated

